<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>SSH on Life &amp; Code</title><link>https://itony.net/tags/ssh/</link><description>Recent content in SSH on Life &amp; Code</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 17 Jul 2017 08:08:08 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://itony.net/tags/ssh/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>SSH一些常见问题</title><link>https://itony.net/ssh-note/</link><pubDate>Mon, 17 Jul 2017 08:08:08 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://itony.net/ssh-note/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="1系统警告could-not-open-a-connection-to-your-authentication-agent"&gt;1、系统警告&lt;code&gt;Could not open a connection to your authentication agent.&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;一般这个问题会出现在你使用&lt;code&gt;ssh-add&lt;/code&gt;命令的时候，究其原因其实很简单就是你还没有启动&lt;code&gt;ssh-agent&lt;/code&gt;，网上有很多解决方式，最便捷的就是直接开启&lt;code&gt;ssh-agent&lt;/code&gt;：&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>